{"work":"tipitaka","version":"sc-pli","book":"an1","chapter":258,"title":"20. Sattamavagga","verses":[
{"v":"1","t":"“Etadaggaṁ, bhikkhave, mama sāvikānaṁ upāsikānaṁ paṭhamaṁ saraṇaṁ gacchantīnaṁ yadidaṁ sujātā seniyadhītā."},
{"v":"2","t":"… Dāyikānaṁ yadidaṁ visākhā migāramātā."},
{"v":"3","t":"… Bahussutānaṁ yadidaṁ khujjuttarā."},
{"v":"4","t":"… Mettāvihārīnaṁ yadidaṁ sāmāvatī."},
{"v":"5","t":"… Jhāyīnaṁ yadidaṁ uttarānandamātā."},
{"v":"6","t":"… Paṇītadāyikānaṁ yadidaṁ suppavāsā koliyadhītā."},
{"v":"7","t":"… Gilānupaṭṭhākīnaṁ yadidaṁ suppiyā upāsikā."},
{"v":"8","t":"… Aveccappasannānaṁ yadidaṁ kātiyānī."},
{"v":"9","t":"… Vissāsikānaṁ yadidaṁ nakulamātā gahapatānī."},
{"v":"10","t":"… Anussavappasannānaṁ yadidaṁ kāḷī upāsikā kuraragharikā”ti. vaggo sattamo. (Etadaggavaggo niṭṭhito.)"}
]}
